{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e0e8d6006945d27fd956","chatId":"ea77f7dec92c4442a71c72b072254c5d","sessionId":null,"userId":53065,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":826,"promptTokens":1523,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:40"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00522012596438799,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0e8d6006945d27fd955","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367720453,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e0e8d6006945d27fd955","chatId":"ea77f7dec92c4442a71c72b072254c5d","sessionId":null,"userId":53065,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n志伟和小兰正在计划一个短途旅行，他们正坐在公园的长椅上翻阅旅游指南。明达虽然没有被邀请参加这次短途旅行，但是还是在他们身后听着他们讨论。突然，志伟注意到明达在一旁，向小兰瞥了一眼。接着，小兰看到了志伟的眼神，摇了摇头，并继续低头看旅游指南。明达看到这个眼神交流，还站在原地。\n\n[问题]\n你认为明达的心情如何？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 明达感到很懊恼，似乎小兰和志伟并不愿意邀请他。\nB. 明达感到兴奋，期待他们会邀请他一起旅行。\nC. 明达感到紧张，他以为志伟和小兰反感他站在后面听计划。\nD. 明达不在意，他觉得志伟和小兰的交流跟他没什么直接关系。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00522012596438799,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0e8d6006945d27fd956","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367720451,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7036b7561e604a9ebc6f09ffbd497f6a"}